htmlcov/

# Local temporary demonstration scratch
.demo-broken-project/

# Veriflow repair-attempt budget sessions: ephemeral per-verification-session
# working state, not something to commit to any project this runs against.
.veriflow/

# Installed copies of the skill. skills/veriflow/ is the single source; an
# install copies it here. Committing a copy means the repo ships two SKILL.md
# files, and every importer (zip, plugin, marketplace) then refuses with
# "multiple SKILL.md found". Keep exactly one in version control.
.claude/skills/
.agents/